{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"443d19965c635fe63afa0a012ef025427106bb48506da531fdd3a36981aee7bf","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"0523b49940c925506089a6f005215f40a9ffc1069275dcc1e83d11c6e9ff35a1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/quests/start-ashes.lua:23-27 (unpinned snapshot, source_file_sha256 8d6636df… matches). The translation changes the meaning in three places: (1) The source 'their righteous revenge on Eyal' is written from the view of a narrator brainwashed by demons, who sees the revenge as righteous. The translation drops 'righteous' and adds '降临', '大举', '入侵' and '无形', which rewrites that view as a neutral account of an invasion. (2) 'your platform of searing earth splits from the main continent' happens while you recover. The translation turns it into '你发现你身处一个和主大陆分离的平台': it drops 'searing earth' and makes the splitting a state that is already over. (3) 'As you recover' is translated '当你醒来后', but the source never says you lost consciousness."},{"revision_key":"0c22616daeea5c4344db3cc9e6d855db76afe7dce0d4e4df28338b7e744b32a2","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:685-709 (sha256 b8a9216d… matches). This is the desc of The Black Boots, a stealth artifact with inc_stealth=10, +CUN, and movement speed from Shadow Power. In 'It's a treacherous road to the top of the world.', 'treacherous road' means a dangerous road that is hard to travel. The translation '背叛之路' (road of betrayal) is a mistranslation, and nothing in the source links the item to betrayal. The source quotation marks around the line (desc = _t[[\"...\"]]) are also missing from the translation."},{"revision_key":"0c451e854a29a4812b250517418d43985480babcf53b24593671ccb6d62ce2c0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0ed56881299d6e08842efe672f4bb7a42238c9b86d9c4f6b0f3b268ecc4a13df","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"100cec57ae5f773c8247a78bc74e6bdbfc1f0db0d466d630e9ac555a0187611d","verdict":"OK"}]}